# Unpublished manuscripts stay out entirely: the point of publishing this code is
# that an outside reader can check the result on its own, without the Processism
# framing, and the manuscripts are not mine to distribute from here.
*.pdf

# private/ IS tracked, deliberately, so the working notes have version history
# while this repository is private. See private/README.md: it must be removed
# before the repository is made public.

